Functional architecture diagram displaying the relationships between Roundcube, Postfix, Dovecot, passdb/userdb LDAP lookups, and storage.\n6. **Matrice de Câblage**:\n   * Marked as **N/A** (Virtual networking).\n7. **Matrice de Flux**:\n   * Full firewall/network flow matrix including source, destination, ports (443, 587, 143/993, 3306, 389, 25, 24), protocols, and descriptions.\n8. **Intervenants & Organisation**:\n   * Matrix detailing project roles (CDP/Architecte/SYS Lin: Amit SAMY, SECU: Nilesh, BO: Moorshid).\n9. **Liste des Tâches, Jalons & Conditions de Réussite**:\n   * Detailed phase checklist, key milestones (pilot domain `ool.fr`, LDAP relocation before `smtp-mtq-1` decommission, queue backlog investigation), and success criteria.\n10. **Annexes**:\n    * Documented data anomaly resolutions and cross-reference to the operational document in the **Infra** collection."}
