{"step_index":353,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T08:26:21Z","thinking":"Simplification requires identifying and summarizing the core technical concepts for a management audience. This entails removing unnecessary technical jargon while emphasizing the business value and impact. Security aspects need distillation into key threats, mitigation strategies, and the overall security posture in a digestible manner.\n\n\nVisualizing the new infrastructure as simplified diagrams highlights reduced operational costs and increased availability, achieved by decommissioning older servers.  Data protection will be enhanced through encryption (TLS/HTTPS) across all mail protocols, with dedicated read-only service accounts, and preservation of password hashes to prevent forced resets.\n\nSecurity posture will be improved with pre- and post-delivery spam filtering, utilizing SPF, DKIM, DMARC, and rate-limiting.  Network segmentation (DMZ, application zone, backend) will restrict user access to critical data and directories.  A phased, domain-specific migration approach enables immediate rollbacks, ensuring data integrity without disruption.  Finally, hardening will include retiring unpatched servers and enforcing new administrative credentials.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"curl -s -X POST https://wiki.corp.intranet.local/api/documents.info \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer ol_api_8rqnwEkj6naMmItaSE8rWwuJiqMrZISmX5RPF3\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"id\": \"e76fbbe9-9f0f-4491-879c-cf68c25b139a\"}' | python3 -c '\nimport sys, json\ndoc = json.load(sys.stdin).get(\"data\", {})\nprint(\"Current Title:\", doc.get(\"title\"))\nprint(\"Current revision:\", doc.get(\"revision\"))\n'","Cwd":"/home/koby","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Checking current LLD doc info","toolSummary":"Get current LLD document revision"}}]}
